+# Vercel AI SDK runtime guidance
+
+For `support`, `/src/support-agent.ts` passes `generateText` an object built by `buildRequest`, and its `prepareStep` callback can replace instructions. Static inspection therefore does not establish which instructions are effective during generation. Preserve the current wrapper unless the unresolved requirement under `agents.support` is resolved through the direct request pattern and runtime verification described there.
